TITLE Pyrite oxidation in pure water, fixed O2, allow Goethite+Gypsum precipitation; report SI Hematite
SOLUTION 1
    temp 25
    pH 7 charge
    units mol/kgw
    -water 1
GAS_PHASE 1
    -fixed_pressure
    -pressure 1
    O2(g) -0.7
EQUILIBRIUM_PHASES 1
    Pyrite 0 0.1
    Goethite 0 0
    Gypsum 0 0
SELECTED_OUTPUT
    -file selected.out
    -reset false
    -si Hematite
END
